<html><body><p>Dear Tom,</p>
<p>We are opening the 2027 rate round. Attached you will find our offer for a=
ll 19 ocean lanes you currently have with us. Due to higher vessel operating =
costs and port surcharges, we are proposing an increase of +6% on every lane,=
 effective 1 January 2027.</p>
<p>The offer is valid until 30 November 2026. To secure allocations for Q1, w=
e would appreciate your answer by 18 November.</p>
